     <details>
      <summary>What is a surface mount pull door operator?</summary>
      <p>A surface mount pull door operator is an automatic swing door operator installed on the pull side of a door. The Omega OA100-SM Pull Series uses a pull-side slide-track arm arrangement for automatic door operation.</p>
     </details>
