     </details>
    </div>

    <div class="op-faq-item">
     <details>
      <summary>What power supply is required for the OA100-SM?</summary>
      <p>The published power supply specification is 120VAC, 60Hz. The operator also lists an on-board power supply of 24 VDC, 1.2 A.</p>
     </details>
    </div>

